      "id": "overview_text",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "label": "",
      "description": "FloLabs - Masterclass\n\nThank you for your interest in joining our Internship Program at FloLabs.\n\nThis form includes key content from our **General Masterclass**, designed to introduce you to the mindset, tools, and vision driving innovation at FloLabs.\n\nThe content you'll encounter represents the foundation of how we think, build, and collaborate. It's part of the journey we're inviting you to be a part of one focused on curiosity, experimentation, and real-world impact.\n\nWe hope you enjoy the process and find the insights as exciting as we do.",
      "required": false,
      "choiceDisplay": "auto",
      "visibleWhenMatch": "all",
      "visibleWhenGroupsMatch": "any",
      "requiredWhenGroupsMatch": "any",
      "width": "full"
    },
