    {
      "id": "admiral_inman_text",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "label": "",
      "description": "Some of our interns recently had the opportunity to participate in two meetings with **Admiral Bobby Ray Inman**, where they shared their experiences and what they've been learning at FloLabs Innovations Group. We believe listening to both the interns' perspectives and Admiral Inman's insights can help you better understand our mission and determine if FloLabs is the right fit for you.\n\nBelow are links to those meeting recordings, along with some background information on Admiral Inman - who, at 93, continues to serve on the Caltech board after 34 years and formerly oversaw JPL NASA:\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bobby_Ray_Inman\nhttps://heritageproject.caltech.edu/interviews-updates/adm-bobby-ray-inman\nhttps://www.caltech.edu/research/jpl\nhttps://www.jpl.nasa.gov\n\nhttps://app.read.ai/analytics/meetings/01HW8QP420A77E3JEFTN8ACSHS?section=notes (Note the meeting starts at 31 minutes and 50 seconds so skip to there)\n\nhttps://app.read.ai/analytics/meetings/01J6D53G4R0WC53M8XR638KERZ?utm_source=Share_CopyLink\n(The meeting begins at the 19-minute mark.)\n\nPlease watch them and answer below 👇",
      "required": false,
      "choiceDisplay": "auto",
      "visibleWhenMatch": "all",
      "visibleWhenGroupsMatch": "any",
      "requiredWhenGroupsMatch": "any",
      "width": "full"
    },
    {
      "id": "admiral_inman_progress",
      "type": "longText",
      "label": "After comparing the second meeting recording to the first one with Admiral Inman, what progress or new directions stood out to you the most?",
      "required": true,
      "choiceDisplay": "auto",
