      "type": "paragraph",
      "label": "",
      "description": "**Please provide at least two references from your most recent roles or experiences.**\n\nWe ask all applicants to list two references from recent academic, volunteer, or professional settings. This supports program integrity and signals that future employers may verify similar experience. If you don't have formal job experience, feel free to list a project supervisor, professor, or mentor.\n\nFor each reference, include:\n• Organization / Company Name\n• Your Role or Title\n• Dates of Involvement\n• Supervisor or Contact Person's Name\n• Their Email and Phone Number",
